<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Now that I’m saved, remember, Lord, my family,</l><l>Their sins You’ve borne, the way has thus been paved;</l><l>This day fulfill the promise You have given:</l><l>“Believe in Christ; your whole house shall be saved.”</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, hear my prayer and gain all in my family!</l><l>My heart is burning with this vow to You:</l><l>“I and my house will serve the Lord forever!”</l><l>We’ll worship God for He alone is true!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
